=== Diagonalization wall-time vs matrix size (LAPACK via eigvals(Symmetric)) ===
   N      time(s)   reps
   200     0.0013   5
   400     0.0061   5
   800     0.0381   5
  1200     0.1419   3
  1600     0.3109   3
  2400     0.9870   1
  3200     2.2397   1

full-range fit p = 2.72  |  asymptotic tail (N>=800) p = 2.91  (ideal=3)
local doubling exponents:
  200->400: time x4.62  -> exponent 2.21
  400->800: time x6.20  -> exponent 2.63
  800->1200: time x3.72  -> exponent 3.24
  1200->1600: time x2.19  -> exponent 2.73
  1600->2400: time x3.17  -> exponent 2.85
  2400->3200: time x2.27  -> exponent 2.85
implied slowdown for 10x larger system (cubic): ~1000x
